{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1344550/extras/fcf6bd7d3c533ddde12d675bc3bed2c0.avif?t=1765999103\" width=616 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warspace 2 is a 1-4 player CO-OP space shooter with RPG elements, open-world and procedurally-generated galaxy. You can trade, craft, and fight your way through a universe, either solo or with friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>1-4 PLAYER CO-OP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1344550/extras/cef5e565652a0ddf178b35846e71069b.poster.avif?t=1765999103\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1344550/extras/cef5e565652a0ddf178b35846e71069b.webm?t=1765999103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1344550/extras/cef5e565652a0ddf178b35846e71069b.mp4?t=1765999103\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Join forces with up to three friends to explore and battle through a vast universe teeming with challenges. You can also play in a single-player offline mode, network connection is not required to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HIGH-TECH EQUIPMENT AND SHIPS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1344550/extras/5dfa95199025114f693d71059344085c.poster.avif?t=1765999103\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1344550/extras/5dfa95199025114f693d71059344085c.webm?t=1765999103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1344550/extras/5dfa95199025114f693d71059344085c.mp4?t=1765999103\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Equip your spaceship with the latest technology. From laser cannons to shield generators, ensure you have the best gear to face the dangers of space and conquer your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EPIC SPACE BATTLES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1344550/extras/8f9cad66c19df0105e754abc442b4b19.poster.avif?t=1765999103\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1344550/extras/8f9cad66c19df0105e754abc442b4b19.webm?t=1765999103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1344550/extras/8f9cad66c19df0105e754abc442b4b19.mp4?t=1765999103\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Engage in intense space battles against a variety of enemies, from space pirates to alien armadas. Use tactical maneuvers, advanced weaponry, and cooperative strategies to outsmart and overpower your adversaries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TRADING - CRAFTING - LOOTING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1344550/extras/b0724d54fce42b50318bccb15e4267e0.poster.avif?t=1765999103\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1344550/extras/b0724d54fce42b50318bccb15e4267e0.webm?t=1765999103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1344550/extras/b0724d54fce42b50318bccb15e4267e0.mp4?t=1765999103\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Engage in a dynamic trading system with different alien civilizations. Craft powerful weapons, advanced technology, and essential supplies. Collect a variety of loot to upgrade your gear, unlock new abilities, and tailor your playstyle to suit your interstellar adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SANDBOX UNIVERSE EXPLORATION</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1344550/extras/95b1e1f8ee9eac6f4e2803ed5e1dfa57.poster.avif?t=1765999103\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1344550/extras/95b1e1f8ee9eac6f4e2803ed5e1dfa57.webm?t=1765999103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1344550/extras/95b1e1f8ee9eac6f4e2803ed5e1dfa57.mp4?t=1765999103\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Explore procedurally generated galaxy with endless possibilities. Discover new planets, meet alien species, and uncover hidden secrets. Every playthrough is different, offering a fresh open-world adventure full of challenges and surprises.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Jump","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1344550/90d3354e2e94c70c46178c3b8b98571152513922.jpg"},{"name":"Explorer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1344550/90d3354e2e94c70c46178c3b8b98571152513922.jpg"},{"name":"High Risk, High Reward","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1344550/90d3354e2e94c70c46178c3b8b98571152513922.jpg"},{"name":"Punching Bag","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1344550/90d3354e2e94c70c46178c3b8b98571152513922.jp